Output demos/catalog/activity.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1500
Set Height 1100
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set CursorBlink false
Set Padding 16

Hide
Type `"$NEWTUI_CATALOG_BIN" --item butterfly_history --width 88 --animate`
Enter
Wait+Screen /SYNTHETIC LIVE/
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 12s
Type " r......"
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/widgets/generated/butterfly-history.png
Sleep 1s
Down 4
Type " "
Sleep 14s
Type " r........."
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/widgets/generated/core-grid-live.png
Sleep 1s
Left 10
Sleep 1s
Right 10
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 200ms
